{"id":"user-turn-2f20e3d9bcdfdf448d5c0f9ea1a01d36-1","sessionId":"7f64a5a6-4823-1340-5268-020509e6e15d","turnId":"turn-2f20e3d9bcdfdf448d5c0f9ea1a01d36","inputEntryId":null,"createdAt":1794276589301,"updatedAt":1794276589301,"generationStatus":"completed","relatedEntryId":null,"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since the bot got long-term memory, every save_fact makes the next call pay full price for the whole system prompt (logs/usage.jsonl). Fix the caching so a memory write doesn't evict the static instructions. Write what you changed in ANSWER.md.\n\nGround rules: work only inside the current directory. Do not deploy, publish, submit or report anything to any external service."}],"source":"turn_start","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":null}
